================================================================================

1. Subject

   These terms apply to the AdtSuite application, including the provided
   installation packages and the accompanying documentation.

2. Right of use

   The free edition of AdtSuite may be used free of charge, including in
   commercial environments. The right of use is non-exclusive and
   non-transferable.

   Advanced features require a license key. The key is requested directly from
   within the application and is tied to the individual user.

3. Restrictions

   Without prior written consent, the following are prohibited:

   a) distributing, renting or selling the application or its installation
      packages to third parties. Each user obtains the application themselves
      and requests their own license key from within the application;

   b) reverse engineering, decompiling or disassembling, except where mandatory
      law permits;

   c) removing or circumventing the license check.

4. Ownership

   AdtSuite is licensed, not sold. All rights to the program and its source
   code remain with the author.

5. Future versions

   Different terms may apply to future versions, including paid terms. Versions
   already obtained are not affected.

6. Warranty and liability

   The application is provided without warranty. Liability is limited to intent
   and gross negligence, as well as cases of mandatory statutory liability.
   Mandatory statutory rights remain unaffected.

7. Feedback

   Suggestions and bug reports may be used to improve the application without
   compensation.


